    <briefdescription>
<para>A class to represent a multi-channel texture using planar <ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">hmap::Array</ref> storage. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1Texture" kindref="compound">Texture</ref></computeroutput> class represents a multi-channel image/texture. Each channel is stored as a separate <computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref></computeroutput> object, allowing direct use of <computeroutput><ref refid="classhmap_1_1Array" kindref="compound">Array</ref></computeroutput> functions and operators on individual channels without copying. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
